                            {
                              "key": "event_subtitle",
                              "value": {
                                "string_value": "The Recording Academy announced the nominees for the 64th Annual GRAMMY Awards on Tuesday. Artists nominated include Cardi B, Megan Thee Stallion, H.E.R., Ariana Grande, Selena Gomez, Justin Bieber,  Olivia Rodrigo, Billie Eilish, the Foo Fighters, Kanye West and Barack Obama, who was nominated for his audiobook A Promised Land. This is the first time in 30 years the finalists were determined solely by votes from the Academy's thousands of members and not filtered through anonymous committees of experts, the New York Times reports. The ceremony will be held on January 31, 2022, at the Crypto.com Arena in Los Angeles.",
